sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Auditor / authorized reviewer
  participant C7 as CMP-007 Authorization
  participant C9 as CMP-009 Evidence Service
  participant L as Audit Ledger
  participant S as Artefact/Source Stores

  A->>C7: request package for run_id and case_id
  C7-->>A: scoped read grant
  A->>C9: build package + scoped grant
  C9->>C7: receiver-side grant verification
  C9->>L: verify full chain and select ordered run events
  L-->>C9: records + verification report
  C9->>S: resolve approved artefact/source digests
  S-->>C9: immutable references / digest confirmations
  C9->>C9: create manifest and package digest
  C9-->>A: evidence package
  Note over A,S: package contains concise evidence, decisions, actions and outcomes; no hidden model chain-of-thought
